igência Artificial.jpg\&q;,\&q;fileHash\&q;:\&q;NKysoz1C3Y3mg1Ltrc1HnrCdg1aCWqoTEa7PSwV88+Y=\&q;,\&q;fileType\&q;:\&q;jpg\&q;,\&q;metadata\&q;:{\&q;pixelWidth\&q;:1366,\&q;pixelHeight\&q;:860,\&q;imageQuality\&q;:79,\&q;description\&q;:\&q;JFIF File\&q;}}],\&q;category\&q;:[{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;de5509e2-7817-47ce-a49a-e2f7fee5d4bd\&q;,\&q;status\&q;:\&q;PUBLISHED\&q;,\&q;data\&q;:{\&q;id\&q;:{\&q;iv\&q;:\&q;legislacao\&q;},\&q;title\&q;:\&q;Legislação\&q;}}],\&q;newDate\&q;:\&q;2026-09-10T00:00:00Z\&q;,\&q;readingTime\&q;:{\&q;iv\&q;:5},\&q;body\&q;:\&q;&l;p style=\\\&q;text-align: left;\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q;&g;O&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;a class=\\\&q;Hyperlink SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; href=\\\&q;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/PT/ALL/?uri=CELEX:32024R1689\\\&q; target=\\\&q;_blank\\\&q; rel=\\\&q;noreferrer noopener\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun Underlined SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; data-ccp-charstyle=\\\&q;Hyperlink\\\&q;&g;Regulamento Europeu de Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; data-ccp-charstyle=\\\&q;Hyperlink\\\&q;&g;(Regulamento (UE) 2024/1689)&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;/a&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;foi alterado pela primeira vez desde a sua ado&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o, em 2024. A revis&a;atilde;o foi introduzida pelo&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;a class=\\\&q;Hyperlink SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; href=\\\&q;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/PT/TXT/PDF/?uri=OJ:L_202601744\\\&q; target=\\\&q;_blank\\\&q; rel=\\\&q;noreferrer noopener\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun Underlined SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; data-ccp-charstyle=\\\&q;Hyperlink\\\&q;&g;Regulamento (UE) 2026/1744&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;/a&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q;&g;, de 8 de julho de 2026, no &a;acirc;mbito do pacote europeu de simplifica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o legislativa conhecido como&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;a class=\\\&q;Hyperlink SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; href=\\\&q;https://www.consilium.europa.eu/pt/press/press-releases/2026/06/29/artificial-intelligence-council-gives-final-green-light-to-simplify-and-streamline-rules/\\\&q; target=\\\&q;_blank\\\&q; rel=\\\&q;noreferrer noopener\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun Underlined SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; data-ccp-charstyle=\\\&q;Hyperlink\\\&q;&g;Digital&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; data-ccp-charstyle=\\\&q;Hyperlink\\\&q;&g;Omnibus&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;/a&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;TextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; xml:lang=\\\&q;PT-PT\\\&q; data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;NormalTextRun SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q;&g;. O novo regulamento foi publicado no Jornal Oficial da Uni&a;atilde;o Europeia a 24 de julho e entrou em vigor a 27 de julho de 2026.&l;/span&g;&l;/span&g;&l;span class=\\\&q;EOP Selected SCXW84242842 BCX8\\\&q; data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\&q;,\&q;additionalContents\&q;:null,\&q;sectionNews\&q;:[{\&q;schemaId\&q;:\&q;3f4d3254-f642-46c5-a2a0-9a4ed5581378\&q;,\&q;schemaName\&q;:\&q;HtmlComponent\&q;,\&q;content\&q;:\&q;&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A altera&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o modifica o calend&a;aacute;rio de aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o de algumas regras, introduz novas pr&a;aacute;ticas proibidas e ajusta v&a;aacute;rios mecanismos previstos no Regulamento&a;nbsp;Europeu para a Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia&a;nbsp;Artificial. A principal mudan&a;ccedil;a para as organiza&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es &a;eacute; o adiamento dos prazos aplic&a;aacute;veis a determinados sistemas de IA de risco elevado.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Novos prazos para os sistemas de risco elevado&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;As regras aplic&a;aacute;veis aos sistemas de Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia&a;nbsp;Artificial&a;nbsp;classificados como de risco elevado ao abrigo do Anexo III passam a aplicar-se a partir de 2 de dezembro de 2027. Est&a;atilde;o abrangidos, entre outros, determinados sistemas utilizados em &a;aacute;reas como biometria, educa&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o, emprego e recrutamento, acesso a servi&a;ccedil;os essenciais, infraestruturas cr&a;iacute;ticas, migra&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o e controlo de fronteiras.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;No caso dos sistemas de&a;nbsp;Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia&a;nbsp;Artificial&a;nbsp;integrados em produtos abrangidos pela legisla&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o europeia de harmoniza&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o e previstos no Anexo I, a aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o das respetivas regras passa para 2 de agosto de 2028.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;O adiamento n&a;atilde;o altera o regime aplic&a;aacute;vel a estes sistemas. As obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es relacionadas com a gest&a;atilde;o de riscos, documenta&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o t&a;eacute;cnica, supervis&a;atilde;o humana e avalia&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o da conformidade mant&a;ecirc;m-se, sendo apenas alterado o calend&a;aacute;rio para a sua aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;O novo prazo permite, contudo, mais tempo para a prepara&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o das normas t&a;eacute;cnicas, orienta&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es e instrumentos necess&a;aacute;rios &a;agrave; aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o destas obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Novas pr&a;aacute;ticas de IA proibidas&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A revis&a;atilde;o introduz tamb&a;eacute;m novas pr&a;aacute;ticas no &a;acirc;mbito do artigo 5.&a;ordm; do&a;nbsp;Regulamento&a;nbsp;Europeu para a&a;nbsp;Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia&a;nbsp;Artificial, que estabelece as utiliza&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es de intelig&a;ecirc;ncia artificial proibidas na Uni&a;atilde;o Europeia.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A partir de 2 de dezembro de 2026, passam a estar abrangidos sistemas concebidos para gerar imagens &a;iacute;ntimas n&a;atilde;o consensuais de pessoas, material de abuso sexual de crian&a;ccedil;as e conte&a;uacute;dos atrav&a;eacute;s de aplica&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es ou servi&a;ccedil;os de &a;ldquo;nudifica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o&a;rdquo;, destinados a remover digitalmente a roupa de uma pessoa numa imagem.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;O regulamento prev&a;ecirc;, contudo, situa&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es em que estas regras n&a;atilde;o se aplicam a sistemas que, pelas suas caracter&a;iacute;sticas t&a;eacute;cnicas e salvaguardas, n&a;atilde;o permitem a gera&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o destes conte&a;uacute;dos, como determinadas ferramentas de modera&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o ou classifica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Altera&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es &a;agrave;s regras de transpar&a;ecirc;ncia&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;As obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es de transpar&a;ecirc;ncia previstas no artigo 50.&a;ordm; n&a;atilde;o s&a;atilde;o adiadas e permanecem aplic&a;aacute;veis desde 2 de agosto de 2026.&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A revis&a;atilde;o introduz, neste &a;acirc;mbito, uma regra transit&a;oacute;ria para os sistemas de gera&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o de conte&a;uacute;dos que j&a;aacute; tenham sido colocados no mercado antes de 2 de agosto de 2026. Nestes casos, os fornecedores disp&a;otilde;em at&a;eacute; 2 de dezembro de 2026 para assegurar o cumprimento da obriga&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o de marca&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o atrav&a;eacute;s de meios leg&a;iacute;veis por m&a;aacute;quina.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Novo prazo para os ambientes de&a;nbsp;teste&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:120}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;O calend&a;aacute;rio relativo aos ambientes de teste&a;nbsp;regulamentar para a intelig&a;ecirc;ncia artificial (AI&a;nbsp;regulatory&a;nbsp;sandboxes) tamb&a;eacute;m foi alterado. Os Estados-Membros passam a dispor at&a;eacute; 2 de agosto de 2027 para assegurar que existe pelo menos um ambiente de teste&a;nbsp;regulamentar operacional a n&a;iacute;vel nacional.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Estes ambientes permitem testar sistemas de Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;em condi&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es controladas, com o acompanhamento das autoridades competentes, contribuindo para uma aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o mais previs&a;iacute;vel e consistente do Regulamento.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Outras altera&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;O Digital&a;nbsp;Omnibus&a;nbsp;introduz ainda ajustamentos destinados a simplificar a aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o do Regulamento&a;nbsp;Europeu para a Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia&a;nbsp;Artificial, nomeadamente em mat&a;eacute;ria de requisitos aplic&a;aacute;veis a pequenas e m&a;eacute;dias empresas e pequenas empresas de m&a;eacute;dia capitaliza&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o, procedimentos de registo e supervis&a;atilde;o de determinados modelos e sistemas.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A revis&a;atilde;o procura tamb&a;eacute;m clarificar a articula&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o entre o Regulamento e outras normas europeias aplic&a;aacute;veis a setores espec&a;iacute;ficos, de forma a reduzir sobreposi&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es e aumentar a seguran&a;ccedil;a jur&a;iacute;dica.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Um novo calend&a;aacute;rio para a aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o do Regulamento&a;nbsp;Europeu para&a;nbsp;a IA&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Com a revis&a;atilde;o, o calend&a;aacute;rio passa a distinguir de forma mais clara as regras que j&a;aacute; est&a;atilde;o em aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o das que ter&a;atilde;o aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o posterior.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;As pr&a;aacute;ticas de Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;proibidas e as obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es de literacia aplicam-se desde 2 de fevereiro de 2025, enquanto as regras relativas aos modelos de finalidade geral s&a;atilde;o aplic&a;aacute;veis desde 2 de agosto de 2025. As obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es de transpar&a;ecirc;ncia previstas no artigo 50.&a;ordm; aplicam-se desde 2 de agosto de 2026.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;As novas pr&a;aacute;ticas proibidas e a regra transit&a;oacute;ria relativa &a;agrave; marca&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o de conte&a;uacute;dos de sistemas j&a;aacute; colocados no mercado aplicam-se a partir de 2 de dezembro de 2026. Os ambientes de teste&a;nbsp;regulamentar devem estar operacionais at&a;eacute; 2 de agosto de 2027. As regras para os sistemas de risco elevado abrangidos pelo Anexo III aplicam-se a partir de 2 de dezembro de 2027 e as relativas aos sistemas abrangidos pelo Anexo I a partir de 2 de agosto de 2028.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:0}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;O que significa para as organiza&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es?&l;/span&g;&l;/strong&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:120}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A revis&a;atilde;o do&a;nbsp;Regulamento Europeu de Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;d&a;aacute; &a;agrave;s organiza&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es mais tempo para preparar o cumprimento das regras aplic&a;aacute;veis aos sistemas de risco elevado, mas n&a;atilde;o interrompe a aplica&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o das restantes obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;As entidades que desenvolvem, fornecem ou utilizam sistemas de&a;nbsp;Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;devem, por isso, atualizar os seus calend&a;aacute;rios de conformidade e distinguir entre as obriga&a;ccedil;&a;otilde;es que j&a;aacute; se encontram em vigor, as que t&a;ecirc;m novos prazos e as novas pr&a;aacute;ticas que passam a ser proibidas.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Em Portugal, o&a;nbsp;Regulamento Europeu de Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;&a;eacute; diretamente aplic&a;aacute;vel, n&a;atilde;o sendo necess&a;aacute;ria&a;nbsp;a&a;nbsp;sua transposi&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o para a legisla&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o nacional. A revis&a;atilde;o europeia deve, assim, ser refletida nos processos de prepara&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o e conformidade das entidades abrangidas.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;A altera&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o do Regulamento representa, sobretudo, uma revis&a;atilde;o do calend&a;aacute;rio e de algumas regras do regime europeu de intelig&a;ecirc;ncia artificial, mantendo-se o objetivo de assegurar uma utiliza&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o da&a;nbsp;Intelig&a;ecirc;ncia Artificial&a;nbsp;compat&a;iacute;vel com a seguran&a;ccedil;a, os direitos fundamentais e a inova&a;ccedil;&a;atilde;o na Uni&a;atilde;o Europeia.&l;/span&g;&l;span data-ccp-props=\\\&q;{&a;quot;335559739&a;quot;:200}\\\&q;&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&a;nbsp;&l;/p&g;\\n&l;p&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;Acompanhe este tema em:&a;nbsp;&l;/span&g;&l;a href=\\\&q;https://digital.gov.pt/pt/estrategia-digital/regulamentacao/ai-act\\\&q;&g;&l;span data-contrast=\\\&q;none\\\&q;&g;https://digital.gov.pt/pt/estrategia-digital/regulamentacao/ai-act&l;/span&g;&l;/a&g;&l;/p&g;\&q;,\&q;css\&q;:null}],\&q;seo\&q;:{\&q;title\&q;:\&q;Regulamento Europeu de Inteligência Artificial revisto: novos prazos e novas regras\&q;,\&q;description\&q;:\&q;A revisão do Regulamento Europeu de IA altera prazos e introduz novas regras.\&q;,\&q;image\&q;:[{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;7eb84033-1634-48d8-b367-5976e23393f2\&q;,\&q;mimeType\&q;:\&q;image/jpeg\&q;,\&q;url\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/7eb84033-1634-48d8-b367-5976e23393f2/\&q;,\&q;thumbnailUrl\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/7eb84033-1634-48d8-b367-5976e23393f2?width=100&a;mode=Max\&q;,\&q;fileName\&q;:\&q;Regulamento Europeu de Inteligência Artificial.jpg\&q;,\&q;fileHash\&q;:\&q;NKysoz1C3Y3mg1Ltrc1HnrCdg1aCWqoTEa7PSwV88+Y=\&q;,\&q;fileType\&q;:\&q;jpg\&q;,\&q;metadata\&q;:{\&q;pixelWidth\&q;:1366,\&q;pixelHeight\&q;:860,\&q;imageQuality\&q;:79,\&q;description\&q;:\&q;JFIF File\&q;}}]}}}]},\&q;extensions\&q;:{\&q;tracing\&q;:{\&q;version\&q;:1,\&q;startTime\&q;:\&q;2026-09-15T09:53:41.8084026Z\&q;,\&q;endTime\&q;:\&q;2026-09-15T09:53:42.0248929Z\&q;,\&q;duration\&q;:216490300,\&q;parsing\&q;:{\&q;startOffset\&q;:1600,\&q;duration\&q;:99900},\&q;validation\&q;:{\&q;startOffset\&q;:104100,\&q;duration\&q;:2798400},\&q;execution\&q;:{\&q;resolvers\&q;:[]}}}}&q;,&q;G.json.https://gateway2.digital.gov.pt/etic/etic/api/legacy/contents/SeeAlso?filter=data/slug ne &s;pt/noticias/regulamento-europeu-de-inteligencia-artificial-novos-prazos-e-novas-regras&s; and (data/Tags eq &s;Inteligência Artificial&s; or data/Tags eq &s;IA&s; or data/Tags eq &s;Ai ACT&s; or data/Tags eq &s;União Europeia&s;)&a;locale=pt&q;:{&q;body&q;:{&q;data&q;:{&q;querySeeAlsoNews&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;8789b622-2e04-4ad2-b192-ae6af4f4b33d&q;,&q;created&q;:&q;2026-09-01T09:09:41Z&q;,&q;lastModified&q;:&q;2026-09-01T09:13:32Z&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;title&q;:&q;Novas regras de transparência para a Inteligência Artificial&q;,&q;slug&q;:&q;pt/noticias/novas-regras-de-transparencia-ia&q;,&q;tags&q;:[&q;Inteligência Artificial&q;,&q;IA&q;,&q;Obrigações de Transparência&q;,&q;União Europeia&q;],&q;teaser&q;:&q;As obrigações de transparência do Regulamento de IA já são aplicáveis.&q;,&q;newImage&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;f91d00db-0d69-4524-b799-fcec5f31fdd6&q;,&q;mimeType&q;:&q;image/jpeg&q;,&q;url&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/f91d00db-0d69-4524-b799-fcec5f31fdd6/&q;,&q;thumbnailUrl&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/f91d00db-0d69-4524-b799-fcec5f31fdd6?width=100&a;mode=Max&q;,&q;fileName&q;:&q;Novas regras de transparência para a Inteligência Artificial.jpg&q;,&q;fileHash&q;:&q;oBfvVtcZ9a8PbxnlkRFrYfa4K3OVaUKgwNZmwMiNd9w=&q;,&q;fileType&q;:&q;jpg&q;,&q;metadata&q;:{&q;pixelWidth&q;:1366,&q;pixelHeight&q;:860,&q;imageQuality&q;:79,&q;description&q;:&q;JFIF File&q;}}],&q;newImageMobile&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;f91d00db-0d69-4524-b799-fcec5f31fdd6&q;,&q;mimeType&q;:&q;image/jpeg&q;,&q;url&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/f91d00db-0d69-4524-b799-fcec5f31fdd6/&q;,&q;thumbnailUrl&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/f91d00db-0d69-4524-b799-fcec5f31fdd6?width=100&a;mode=Max&q;,&q;fileName&q;:&q;Novas regras de transparência para a Inteligência Artificial.jpg&q;,&q;fileHash&q;:&q;oBfvVtcZ9a8PbxnlkRFrYfa4K3OVaUKgwNZmwMiNd9w=&q;,&q;fileType&q;:&q;jpg&q;,&q;metadata&q;:{&q;pixelWidth&q;:1366,&q;pixelHeight&q;:860,&q;imageQuality&q;:79,&q;description&q;:&q;JFIF File&q;}}],&q;category&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;de5509e2-7817-47ce-a49a-e2f7fee5d4bd&q;,&q;status&q;:&q;PUBLISHED&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;id&q;:{&q;iv&q;:&q;legislacao&q;},&q;title&q;:&q;Legislação&q;}}],&q;newDate&q;:&q;2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&q;,&q;readingTime&q;:{&q;iv&q;:5}}},{&q;id&q;:&q;632f77cc-1b90-424b-a79d-0161d69d94b0&q;,&q;created&q;:&q;2026-03-09T09:56:17Z&q;,&q;lastModified&q;:&q;2026-07-21T14:58:19Z&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;title&q;:&q;Participe na elaboração da segunda versão do Código de Prática sobre transparência em conteúdos gerados por IA&q;,&q;slug&q;:&q;pt/noticias/participe-na-elaboracao-da-segunda-versao-do-codigo-de-pratica-sobre-transparencia-em-conteudos-gerados-por-ia&q;,&q;tags&q;:[&q;Inteligência Artificial&q;,&q;AI Act&q;,&q;Comissão Europeia&q;,&q;Consulta Pública&q;,&q;Deepfakes&q;,&q;Código de Prática&q;,&q;Sistemas de IA&q;],&q;teaser&q;:&q;A Comissão Europeia convida todos os interessados a contribuir para a segunda versão do Código de Prática sobre transparência em conteúdos gerados por IA.&q;,&q;newImage&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;6563f343-f6c1-4666-8376-6f40afd73eb9&q;,&q;mimeType&q;:&q;image/jpeg&q;,&q;url&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/6563f343-f6c1-4666-8376-6f40afd73eb9/&q;,&q;thumbnailUrl&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/6563f343-f6c1-4666-8376-6f40afd73eb9?width=100&a;mode=Max&q;,&q;fileName&q;:&q;conceito-de-transformacao-digital-de-fundo-de-microchip-de-tecnologia-de-ia.jpg&q;,&q;fileHash&q;:&q;qDdJvCWSeJI9gQs2Q0fmsPKlO7sPoZ3OB+BuCHQLs6U=&q;,&q;fileType&q;:&q;jpg&q;,&q;metadata&q;:{&q;pixelWidth&q;:5001,&q;pixelHeight&q;:3335,&q;created&q;:&q;2021-05-19T08:02:33+00:00&q;,&q;imageQuality&q;:100,&q;description&q;:&q;JFIF File&q;}}],&q;newImageMobile&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;6563f343-f6c1-4666-8376-6f40afd73eb9&q;,&q;mimeType&q;:&q;image/jpeg&q;,&q;url&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/6563f343-f6c1-4666-8376-6f40afd73eb9/&q;,&q;thumbnailUrl&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/6563f343-f6c1-4666-8376-6f40afd73eb9?width=100&a;mode=Max&q;,&q;fileName&q;:&q;conceito-de-transformacao-digital-de-fundo-de-microchip-de-tecnologia-de-ia.jpg&q;,&q;fileHash&q;:&q;qDdJvCWSeJI9gQs2Q0fmsPKlO7sPoZ3OB+BuCHQLs6U=&q;,&q;fileType&q;:&q;jpg&q;,&q;metadata&q;:{&q;pixelWidth&q;:5001,&q;pixelHeight&q;:3335,&q;created&q;:&q;2021-05-19T08:02:33+00:00&q;,&q;imageQuality&q;:100,&q;description&q;:&q;JFIF File&q;}}],&q;category&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;4fa18209-2ee3-4fb4-b02a-1a8133cff737&q;,&q;status&q;:&q;PUBLISHED&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;id&q;:{&q;iv&q;:&q;transformacao-digital&q;},&q;title&q;:&q;Transformação Digital&q;}}],&q;newDate&q;:&q;2026-03-09T00:00:00Z&q;,&q;readingTime&q;:{&q;iv&q;:5}}},{&q;id&q;:&q;52e7352d-360e-4070-b6d2-4ae14d1dae2f&q;,&q;created&q;:&q;2026-05-12T10:10:16Z&q;,&q;lastModified&q;:&q;2026-07-21T10:40:20Z&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;title&q;:&q;Portugal e o princípio \&q;só uma vez\&q; na União Europeia&q;,&q;slug&q;:&q;pt/noticias/portugal-e-o-principio-so-uma-vez-na-uniao-europeia&q;,&q;tags&q;:[&q;Once-Only Technical System&q;,&q;OOTS&q;,&q;União Europeia&q;,&q;eIDAS&q;],&q;teaser&q;:&q;O OOTS evita apresentar documentos já detidos por autoridades.&q;,&q;newImage&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;3361c612-cd73-47c7-a7d1-821a8772f058&q;,&q;mimeType&q;:&q;image/jpeg&q;,&q;url&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3361c612-cd73-47c7-a7d1-821a8772f058/&q;,&q;thumbnailUrl&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3361c612-cd73-47c7-a7d1-821a8772f058?width=100&a;mode=Max&q;,&q;fileName&q;:&q;portugal-e-o-principio-so-uma-vez-na-uniao-europeia.jpg&q;,&q;fileHash&q;:&q;ys2CvQaJDHtKAjWp7GkI0w3XPPqq/sIQ1Nn2dd0r4Ig=&q;,&q;fileType&q;:&q;jpg&q;,&q;metadata&q;:{&q;pixelWidth&q;:1366,&q;pixelHeight&q;:860,&q;imageQuality&q;:79,&q;description&q;:&q;JFIF File&q;}}],&q;newImageMobile&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;3361c612-cd73-47c7-a7d1-821a8772f058&q;,&q;mimeType&q;:&q;image/jpeg&q;,&q;url&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3361c612-cd73-47c7-a7d1-821a8772f058/&q;,&q;thumbnailUrl&q;:&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3361c612-cd73-47c7-a7d1-821a8772f058?width=100&a;mode=Max&q;,&q;fileName&q;:&q;portugal-e-o-principio-so-uma-vez-na-uniao-europeia.jpg&q;,&q;fileHash&q;:&q;ys2CvQaJDHtKAjWp7GkI0w3XPPqq/sIQ1Nn2dd0r4Ig=&q;,&q;fileType&q;:&q;jpg&q;,&q;metadata&q;:{&q;pixelWidth&q;:1366,&q;pixelHeight&q;:860,&q;imageQuality&q;:79,&q;description&q;:&q;JFIF File&q;}}],&q;category&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;4fa18209-2ee3-4fb4-b02a-1a8133cff737&q;,&q;status&q;:&q;PUBLISHED&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;id&q;:{&q;iv&q;:&q;transformacao-digital&q;},&q;title&q;:&q;Transformação Digital&q;}}],&q;newDate&q;:&q;2026-05-12T00:00:00Z&q;,&q;readingTime&q;:{&q;iv&q;:5}}}],&q;querySeeAlsoDocuments&q;:[{&q;id&q;:&q;b5fcdba9-62e3-4e8f-b7e5-6bc821adef6a&q;,&q;created&q;:&q;2022-09-28T12:11:03Z&q;,&q;lastModified&q;:&q;2026-07-14T10:24:57Z&q;,&q;data&q;:{&q;title&q;:&q;GuIA –